   "Atlas/Rudvalis/HeavyCoordinateTests.lean:4:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `theorem fixedHeavy_pair_avoid_translate (p c : Point) (hpc : p ≠ c)\n    (v : FixedHeavyParameters c) (x : E) :\n    ∃ b : E, fixedHeavyWord c v (p, x + b) = 0 ∧ fixedHeavyWord c v (p, x + p.val + b) = 0 := by\n  classical\n  have hc := fixedHeavy_row_pairs_card c p v\n  rw [ite_eq_right hpc] at hc\n  have hn :\n    (Finset.univ.filter\n        (fun y : E => fixedHeavyWord c v (p, y) = 0 ∧ fixedHeavyWord c v (p, y + p.val) = 0)).Nonempty :=\n    Finset.card_pos.mp (by rw [hc]; decide)\n  obtain ⟨y, hy⟩ := hn\n  have hy := (Finset.mem_filter.mp hy).2\n  refine ⟨y + x, ?_, ?_⟩\n  · have he : x + (y + x) = y := by rw [add_comm y x, ← add_assoc, vector_add_self, zero_add]\n    rw [he]\n    exact hy.1\n  · have he : x + p.val + (y + x) = y + p.val := by\n      calc\n        _ = (x + x) + (y + p.val) := by abel\n        _ = y + p.val := by rw [vector_add_self, zero_add]\n    rw [he]\n    exact hy.2`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
